# configure and place in ~/.config/isyncrc
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

IMAPAccount personal
Host myhost
User myusername
Pass mypass
SSLType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore personal-remote
Account personal

MaildirStore personal-local
Path ~/doc/mail/personal/
Inbox ~/doc/mail/personal/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel personal
Far :personal-remote:
Near :personal-local:
Patterns *
